    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/e53fbdd2066c850103ae0caac63c2071.avif?t=1730711301\" width=600 height=800 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/a927014e4c495e99ca25999660144cea.poster.avif?t=1730711301\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/a927014e4c495e99ca25999660144cea.webm?t=1730711301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/a927014e4c495e99ca25999660144cea.mp4?t=1730711301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Through the Thorns and Curses</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder fused with a tabletop RPG. Take on the role of a wanderer who has entered a strange land under a mysterious curse. Build your deck, challenge yourself, and free the land from its curse. But beware, time is not on your side!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/0432c0c283ef90435861dfe2ecdf81dc.poster.avif?t=1730711301\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/0432c0c283ef90435861dfe2ecdf81dc.webm?t=1730711301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/0432c0c283ef90435861dfe2ecdf81dc.mp4?t=1730711301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/322398c9e337e2a7a3a69467e6eac193.avif?t=1730711301\" width=600 height=87 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i><strong>Visual Style</strong></i>: The game world is inspired by tabletop games and presented in the form of a shuffled deck of cards.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/52f9b290350129a1c2ccfa308d2c8b66.poster.avif?t=1730711301\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/52f9b290350129a1c2ccfa308d2c8b66.webm?t=1730711301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/52f9b290350129a1c2ccfa308d2c8b66.mp4?t=1730711301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><i><strong>Combat System</strong></i>: Play any number of cards from your hand - explore and discover the best combinations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/f202c4188552e384b05c08a2b0b27aa8.poster.avif?t=1730711301\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/f202c4188552e384b05c08a2b0b27aa8.webm?t=1730711301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/f202c4188552e384b05c08a2b0b27aa8.mp4?t=1730711301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><i><strong>Replayability</strong></i>: Choose a character and scenario - each playthrough offers a new game field, events, cards in combat, and ability cards.<br><br></li><li><i><strong>Opponents</strong></i>: Each opponent has their own deck. Explore opponent decks and find a unique approach to each one.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/79e1494e5ccdcce2ec30dcaab480f328.poster.avif?t=1730711301\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/79e1494e5ccdcce2ec30dcaab480f328.webm?t=1730711301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/79e1494e5ccdcce2ec30dcaab480f328.mp4?t=1730711301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><i><strong>Risk and Reward</strong></i>: The outcome of the battle is in your deck - add combat trophies and wounds to your hand and decide whether to move forward.</li></ul>",
