em_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/79e1494e5ccdcce2ec30dcaab480f328.webm?t=1730711301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739850/extras/79e1494e5ccdcce2ec30dcaab480f328.mp4?t=1730711301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><i><strong>Risk and Reward</strong></i>: The outcome of the battle is in your deck - add combat trophies and wounds to your hand and decide whether to move forward.</li></ul>",
